  {
    "name": "deleting 60 files at once goes through (under the breaker's share) and lands in the other device's trash",
    "description": "SYNCCOM-017 (Sync.com): bulk deletes of 50+ files could fail. Rules D1/D2: 60 of 200 files is not a mass delete (not more than half), so it is applied, recoverable from the trash and the drive's versions.",
    "steps": [
      { "op": "drive_harness" },
      { "op": "drive_create", "remote": "r" },
